  "diagnosis": [
    "Inline field rendering used generated AmigaOS type IDs/extents only; custom canonical types could not resolve their fields.",
    "Canonical RSSET struct_instance declarations were absent from the inferred pointer-slot vector. Injecting them there would incorrectly equate an object address with its first stored LONG."
  ],
  "shared_fix": [
    "Read-only renderer projection combines existing canonical inline declarations with inferred inline contracts; it does not alter pointer-cell analysis or add a persistence lane.",
    "Type identity, size and field expressions reuse the existing policy-aware analysis resolver. The duplicate OS-only field extent scan is removed.",
    "Require app layout/base, full declared extent and signed displacement reach. Ambiguous views, padding, pointer fields and short extents keep numeric/ordinary aliases; explicit use-site bindings retain priority."
  ],
